// Bring the Stratostacean down (openspec/changes/crab-airship, section 10): free roam in the Foreman, the mission
// started from the mail (M, START). The fortress appears over the nearest city's centre and flies out onto its
// circle; the pilot boards, picks the autocannon, and stands off each lift thruster of the weaker side until its
// nozzle is at most 22 deg up, then puts the autocannon into it; with three gone the hull thrusters light, and the
// pilot locks them one at a time and puts missiles up into their ports: two of the three bring it down. It gets clear
// as it falls and watches it crash and explode. Once it has crashed, the pilot takes out every
// hostile left (its fighters, its deck guard, any vehicle; owner, 2026-10-30). First person throughout.
//
// Any mech with an autocannon and missiles plays it; the take is flown in the Harrow, whose cockpit sees out through
// its top (owner, 2026-10-30), its racks' salvos locking the hull ports:
//
//   ./target/release/crab-breeze --playtest fortress-down --mech mechs/harrow.ron
(
    name: "fortress-down",
    stuck_s: 60.0,
    runs: [
        (
            play: "free",
            beats: [
                Wait(2.0),
                Board,
                Wait(2.0),
                SelectWeapon("autocannon"),
                StartMission("Fortress"),
                Wait(4.0),
                Survey(3000.0),
                LookAtNearest("fortress", 4.0),
                BringDownFortress(900.0),
                ClearHostiles(600.0),
                Survey(2000.0),
                // about a minute more once every goal is done (owner, 2026-10-30)
                LookAround(60.0),
            ],
        ),
    ],
)
